WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.491 --> 00:00:06.260
 You probably know me,
if you know me at all,

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.790
as someone who does this.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:09.140
[CELLO NOTES]

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.390
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:15.500
 There has come to us
a young man, aged seven,

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.990
bearing the name Yo-Yo Ma.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.030
 I've been playing the
cello for over 60 years,

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:27.880
so I should be getting
it right, by now.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.860
However, is that what
I'm trying to do?

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:33.130
Am I trying to get it right or
am I trying to find something?

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:36.160
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:38.440
This is not an
ordinary MasterClass.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:42.230
I really don't like
to tell people things.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:45.020
So I hope you won't
expect me to do that.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:46.960
But during our time
together, we're

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:50.200
going to talk about what
creates magical moments.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.380
That magic is something living.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.500
And to me, that's
the essence of what

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.620
I try to do in music,
transmitting something

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:02.470
so it lives in somebody else.

00:01:05.976 --> 00:01:07.810
[CELLO]

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:11.290
At one point, I had
the audacity to think

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:14.420
I could play a perfect concert.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.190
I was in the middle
of a concert and I

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.250
realized everything's
going perfectly well.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.380
And I was bored out of my mind.

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:25.070
That was the moment that
I made a fateful decision

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:28.070
that I was actually
going to devote

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:36.585
my life to human expression,
versus human perfection.

00:01:36.585 --> 00:01:39.540
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.070
Music connects people.

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:43.470
You're sharing
something with others.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:48.686
You're almost like the
scientist for the inner soul.

00:01:48.686 --> 00:01:51.790
The whole act of
life is a balance

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:55.330
of unbelievably
intricate forces,

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:59.560
of which music is a subset.

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:03.070
I'm Yo-Yo Ma, and
this is MasterClass.

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:06.420
[MUSIC PLAYING]

